# The sound chain at its extremes, and in between: Paula and clean playback, crush, the A500 and LED
# filters, the three drive shapes, the DJ filter swept both ways at full resonance, the echo at full
# feedback, the volume. Never silent, never out of range or NaN. Audio: sound.wav
wav sound.wav
wait 200
tap PLAY
wait 1500
peakreset
# crush all the way, then back
spin K3 100
wait 1200
spin K3 -60
# clean playback, then Paula again; the Amiga filters
tap FX
spin K3 1
wait 600
spin K3 -1
spin K4 1
wait 600
spin K4 1
wait 600
spin K4 1
wait 600
spin K4 -3
# drive: soft, hard, fold, all the way
spin K1 100
wait 600
spin K2 1
wait 600
spin K2 1
wait 600
spin K1 -100
spin K2 -2
# echo, full feedback, every time
tap FX
spin K1 100
spin K3 100
spin K4 100
wait 800
spin K2 1
wait 400
spin K2 1
wait 400
spin K2 1
wait 400
spin K2 1
wait 400
spin K2 1
wait 400
spin K1 -100
spin K3 -60
# the DJ filter: down, up, at full resonance
tap HOME
turn K1 -64 20
wait 800
turn K1 128 20
wait 800
turn K1 -64 20
# pitch and volume
spin K2 24
wait 600
spin K2 -48
wait 600
spin K2 24
tap GLO
tap GLO
spin K4 6
wait 600
spin K4 -30
wait 600
spin K4 24
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 3000
wavstop
expect bad_samples 0
expect peak_db_max 0.1
expect peak_db_min -14
